# The i3 session for systemd. graphical-session.target refuses a manual
# start; a session target binds it instead (systemd.special(7)).
# xdg-desktop-portal requires it since Fedora 45, and Firefox reads the
# color-scheme (~/bin/theme) through the portal.
#
# ~/.xprofile starts it; the i3 exit binding stops it. Linked by bootstrap.sh.
[Unit]
Description=i3 session
Documentation=man:systemd.special(7)
BindsTo=graphical-session.target
Wants=graphical-session-pre.target
After=graphical-session-pre.target
